Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:59:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 266/289] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the Usage card
 re-reads after a login switch

Keep the follow-up re-reads in a per-chat module-level schedule so closing the composer menu does not cancel them, schedule them only after a switch that went through, add a 60 s tail, and cover the hook and the family dialog's failure path with tests.
